/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >希望大家多多支持我们吧！</p>", "short_description": "《山海幻境》是首款以像素画风探索山海神话的三消即时战斗+卡牌RPG游戏！ 每天点一点，上班摸鱼下班放空；指尖消一消，即时战斗激爽三消！ 山海游一游，游历八荒共斗异兽；BOSS打一打，每周8张自选英雄！ 所有养成资源均有免费产出途径，不花钱的研究型玩家也能爽玩； 氪金玩家可以通过付费，提升养成速度，获得快速养成的快感！", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4790710/88232016a624835ab103ebc5f5fab4453c767823/header.jpg?t=1788144080", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4790710/e9a955ed39f6c52419ceb3566d6109ea00dc2b98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788144080", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4790710/e9a955ed39f6c52419ceb3566d6109ea00dc2b98/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788144080", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or DirectX 11 compatible graphics card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows-compatible audio device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8192 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 / Intel Iris Xe